                <note rend="inline" type="source">Hopkins Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Prime Minister Churchill to the President’s Special Assistant</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Hopkins</hi>)<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d15-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-04-11">April 11, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I cannot help being much disappointed by your telegram.</p>
            </div>
